{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chop Chop: Together</strong> is a chaotic 2\u20134 player co-op action game where you and your friends take on hilarious jobs and race against the clock! Work as housemates juggling different professions\u2014fishers, warehouse packers, chefs, and more\u2014in fast-paced levels full of teamwork, chaos, and a pinch of sabotage.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065360/extras/ChopChopTogether_Lobby.gif?t=1745241428\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa3 Catch, cut, dry, cook, and deliver fish with perfect timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065360/extras/Fishing_.png?t=1745241428\" /><br>\ud83d\udce6 Pack orders in busy warehouses and make sure the right items reach the truck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 Compete for the highest score or cooperate to beat the level\u2014your choice!<br>\ud83d\udd13 Unlock new professions, tougher challenges, and quirky cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065360/extras/cct_gif_cargo.gif?t=1745241428\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're working hand-in-hand or throwing each other overboard, <i>Chop Chop: Together</i> guarantees unforgettable moments full of laughter and mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab your friends, pick a job, and get ready to chop chop!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3065360?t=1745241428","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065360/2e53a4b471283bcf587e6003d98175df59e4f031/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745241428","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065360/13943d107a4604e984e0f055ced0f06081e2d65a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=17452414